---
title: "FilePizza download, pause, and resume"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Recipient opens the download
  s1: Connection closed
  s2: Download failed
  s3: Reading the next piece
  s4: Download paused
  s5: Final piece received
  s6: Piece received
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the connection closes
  s0 --> s2: the transfer fails
  s0 --> s3: recipient starts downloading
  s3 --> s1: the connection closes
  s3 --> s2: the transfer fails
  s3 --> s4: recipient pauses
  s3 --> s6: the piece arrives
  s3 --> s5: the piece arrives
  s4 --> s1: the connection closes
  s4 --> s2: the transfer fails
  s4 --> s3: recipient resumes
  s5 --> s1: the connection closes
  s5 --> s2: the transfer fails
  s5 --> s4: recipient pauses
  s5 --> s3: recipient starts again
  s6 --> s1: the connection closes
  s6 --> s2: the transfer fails
  s6 --> s4: recipient pauses
  s6 --> s3: next piece is due or recipient restarts
